  "details": "It’s been a couple of days now since it happened the first time and it’s starting to get on my nerves. Everytime I start up vrchat everything goes smooth until I have to load in the world I’m stuck on the loading screen. It won’t budge at all. \n\n•I’ve tried uninstalling and reinstalling \n\n•I’ve checked my WiFi looks completely fine\n\n•I’ve done a factory reset on my oculus quest 2\n\n•proceeded to buy a new headset nothing changed\n\n•when I am able to join in I don’t get any invites or messages and I can’t send any either \n\n•I did a factory reset on my new quest 3\n\n•I forced an update \n\nNothing seems to work at all.\n\nI am a stand alone quest and I really want to start playing vrchat decently again.\n\nPlease help me out",
